      <LongDescription>The &lt;noparse&gt;SSM-100 Gull Block VI&lt;/noparse&gt; is a size 1 direct guidance missile.  It is based on the SSM-1 body, which is a nimble space-superiority missile.  This missile will deliver a $MISSILEWARHEAD_DETAIL_BLASTFRAG warhead.  It homes in on its target using an Active Radar seeker  If the primary seeker does not find a target or is jammed, it can fall back on a Passive Wake seeker.

